Bundled runtime dependency for the offline localhost explorer graph.

Package: 3d-force-graph
Version: 1.80.0
Source: https://www.npmjs.com/package/3d-force-graph / https://github.com/vasturiano/3d-force-graph
License: MIT

This minified browser bundle is served locally from package data so the personal
explorer does not make CDN/runtime network calls. The bundle includes its own
runtime dependencies from the upstream browser distribution, including Three.js
(MIT) and helper packages used by 3d-force-graph. Preserve upstream copyright
and license notices when redistributing.
